<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκοπ-έω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκέψομαι</span> : pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έσκεμμαι</span> in act. sense, <i><span class="en">
			S.E.
			<u>M.</u>
			2.53
		</span></i> ; in pass. sense, v. infr. <i><span class="en">
			11.3
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look
			round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				897
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				155e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ax.</u>
				364a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				487
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>examine, observe carefully</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αὐτίκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.36
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν αἰγιαλόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					80
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτα -σκέψασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					199
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					1.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>consider well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ περισκέψασθαι τὰ μέλλει
					ἀσφαλέστατα εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.120
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὁπότεροι κρατήσουσι</span>
			<i>watch and see</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.49
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἴτε . . εἴτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					313a
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀφανῆ π</span>. <i>speculate
				on</i> hidden things, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				737
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φύσιν
			περιεσκεμμένος</span> cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				365b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιεσκεμμένος</span>, in pass. sense,
				<i>circumspect, guarded</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμη,
				ἔπαινος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				34.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				59
			</span></i>.</div>
